<title>USA: Liberty Bancorp (Okla.) raises qtly div.</title>
<headline>Liberty Bancorp (Okla.) raises qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberty Bancorp Inc said Friday it increased its dividend, declaring a quarterly dividend of $0.30 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on February 14 to shareholders of record on January 31, the company said.</p>
<p>During 1996, the quarterly dividend was $0.25.</p>
